<title>JAPAN: Kyocera - 6mth group results.</title>
<headline>Kyocera - 6mth group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		355.10		vs	  318.13</p>
<p> Operating	   64.13		vs	   56.15</p>
<p> Current	     61.16		vs	  103.22</p>
<p> Net		   25.75		vs	   51.22</p>
<p> EPS		  136.77 yen	  vs	  272.67 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kyocera Corp is a top manufacturer of semiconductor components.</p>
